1
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,879
Don't follow me.

2
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:25,879
If we're seen with bandits,

3
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,280
we'll lose all future business.

4
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:28,680
I'm from Langyue.

5
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,359
I don't belong in the Yun State.

6
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,280
I'm going home.

7
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:33,480
Really.

8
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,159
I never lie to you.

9
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:39,799
My Lord,

10
00:01:40,079 --> 00:01:40,840
should we keep following?

11
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,159
Yes.

12
00:01:56,879 --> 00:01:57,599
Your Majesty.

13
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,799
Grand Preceptor,

14
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,680
I'm aware of

15
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:01,920
your actions.

16
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:07,519
I am terrified.

17
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:14,039
I am ignorant and unruly.

18
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,879
Thanks to your protection,

19
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,039
I haven't gone astray.

20
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,000
I merely drank a bit too much.

21
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,319
It's just a scholar's charm.

22
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,599
Not really mischievous.

23
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,879
You're so careful with talents.

24
00:02:27,719 --> 00:02:30,080
You cherish your own and others' children.

25
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:32,639
You're a role model.

26
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:36,199
You cherish talents.

27
00:02:36,439 --> 00:02:37,879
I'm just

28
00:02:37,879 --> 00:02:40,759
protecting the treasures of the empire.

29
00:02:41,719 --> 00:02:43,560
Thank you, Lord.

30
00:02:44,879 --> 00:02:46,680
I'm honored but terrified.

31
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,240
My son's misconduct

32
00:02:48,439 --> 00:02:50,280
is my failing.

33
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:53,199
I humbly request permission

34
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:56,400
to take him home and discipline him.

35
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:57,759
Your Majesty,

36
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,680
Cheng Qi is frail

37
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:00,800
and loves the arts.

38
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:04,400
He should stay at my residence

39
00:03:04,719 --> 00:03:07,000
to prepare for the upcoming speech contest.

40
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,840
It's a chance to showcase

41
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,400
our nation's talents to foreign lands.

42
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:14,000
The meeting is not urgent.

43
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,719
Cheng Zhao,

44
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,719
your family has been in military for generations.

45
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,479
It's rare to have a literary talent.

46
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:22,240
Don't be too harsh on him.

47
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,039
Remember, moderation is key.

48
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,879
Take him back and let him rest.

49
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,240
Yes, Your Majesty.

50
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:35,879
Since the people of Yun State are plagued by illness,

51
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:38,879
how about changing the content of the meeting

52
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:41,159
to praying for blessings?

53
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,680
Your Majesty's consideration for the people

54
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:48,120
is truly a blessing for the Yun State.

55
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,439
There shouldn't be any sand here.

56
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,840
Something's not right. Hurry into the city.

57
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,360
You lead the way.

58
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,240
Everyone, move quickly.

59
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:17,839
Yes.

60
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,240
Let's go.

61
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,040
I'm Su Yuejiao from the Su's Escort Agency of Yun State.

62
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,360
I'm heading to Klak City.

63
00:04:30,439 --> 00:04:32,000
Please give me a hand.

64
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:35,120
My eyelid has been twitching these days.

65
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:36,560
I'm uneasy.

66
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,480
You know,

67
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:40,000
if something happens to Jiaojiao,

68
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,399
how do I explain to her parents?

69
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,800
With her strength and skills,

70
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,639
ordinary bandits can't hurt her.

71
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:51,800
What if the bandits are not ordinary?

72
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:53,879
What if she insists on "escort her to the end"?

73
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,720
There may be reinforcements.

74
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,519
We should leave now.

75
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,839
I'll stay here

76
00:05:22,839 --> 00:05:23,639
with the escort.

77
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,040
They're gonna take it away.

78
00:05:50,959 --> 00:05:51,839
What if it's fake?

79
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,399
Stand by.

80
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:01,480
Father,

81
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,879
Cheng Qi was taken away by the palace.

82
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:21,519
You're good for nothing!

83
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,519
Relying on your little tricks,

84
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,319
causing me trouble, huh?

85
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,800
Don't meddle

86
00:06:30,199 --> 00:06:31,240
in Cheng Qi's business.

87
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,000
Notify all merchants

88
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:36,000
to check their silver

89
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:38,000
and send it out as planned.

90
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,720
If there's another mistake,

91
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,120
you won't have to come back.

92
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:42,680
I know I was wrong.

93
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,199
I'll take care of it right away.

94
00:06:45,399 --> 00:06:46,800
She's just a concubine's daughter.

95
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:49,000
She's so careless.

96
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:52,000
Qi Jia is back.

97
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:54,680
If I don't come back,

98
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:57,000
I'm afraid you will be mad at her.

99
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,279
Is this little thing

100
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,600
something I can help you with?

101
00:07:01,639 --> 00:07:03,120
Ling Feng comes from a scholarly family.

102
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:05,120
For the oratorical meeting,

103
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,680
even if he doesn't rely on others to write for him,

104
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,879
he can do very well.

105
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:10,079
Thanks to Lord Zhang for not despising me.

106
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,680
Since Ling Feng is the head of Xingyun,

107
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:13,759
I'm willing

108
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:15,639
to help you.

109
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:25,439
Can he do it?

110
00:07:27,759 --> 00:07:28,920
He may not be good at

111
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:29,879
the daily life of the people.

112
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,680
But since the meeting has been changed to pray for the world,

113
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:34,720
and the Ling family has someone working in the Ministry of Rites,

114
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:36,319
these eulogies

115
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,600
are easy for him.

116
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,720
I have been influenced by it since childhood.

117
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,639
If I'm not sure,

118
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:42,399
I wouldn't have volunteered.

119
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,600
When it comes to ceremonial eulogies,

120
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:48,839
Mr. Ling

121
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:50,879
is naturally better than Cheng Qi.

122
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,279
In that case,

123
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:54,680
let's do as Qijia suggested.

124
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:55,720
Yes.

125
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,639
Get out of here.

126
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,600
Don't make me upset.

127
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,240
[Why hasn't she caught up yet?]

128
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,360
Where's the bandit?

129
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:10,680
Oh, no.

130
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:34,320
You tricked us with fake things.

131
00:08:34,639 --> 00:08:35,919
You should be killed.

132
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:38,639
If you can make us happy,

133
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,480
I'll spare your life.

134
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,240
I'd like to see

135
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:45,399
who will be the first to lose their life.

136
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,399
Come on!

137
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,600
[Pottery! Pottery!]

138
00:10:53,879 --> 00:10:55,879
[Look at this fine pot I've made!]

139
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,639
[It's perfect for storing grain!]

140
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,799
This leather is suitable.

141
00:10:58,799 --> 00:11:00,600
Make a shawl and have a look.

142
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,840
Look how well this bow is made.

143
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,879
It's very powerful.

144
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,399
Come and have a look.

145
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:14,279
Coming.

146
00:11:14,279 --> 00:11:15,000
Crown.

147
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:15,639
Come and have a look.

148
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:16,279
Crown.

149
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:16,840
Newly made crown.

150
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,399
Newly made crown.

151
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,200
[Come on, have a drink.]

152
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,519
Go on.

153
00:12:03,279 --> 00:12:04,600
It's me. Don't be afraid.

154
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:11,240
Who are you?

155
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,080
It's me, Bai.

156
00:12:13,279 --> 00:12:13,960
Bai Yanli,

157
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:15,000
your escort.

158
00:12:17,799 --> 00:12:18,960
Escort?

159
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,480
Where is this place?

160
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:25,159
This is the City of Diamond.

161
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,759
We were attacked by bandits.

162
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:27,840
You're injured.

163
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:31,759
Take it easy.

164
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:34,080
Say that again.

165
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,240
This is the City of Klare.

166
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,240
Lie down.

167
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,120
Wait for me here.

168
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,279
How long has she been like this?

169
00:13:05,279 --> 00:13:06,200
Over three days.

170
00:13:06,679 --> 00:13:07,840
Based on what you said,

171
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,159
she must have injured her neck.

172
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:11,399
Then she forced herself to fight,

173
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,600
causing blood to surge upwards,

174
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,840
leading to a concussion.

175
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:20,159
That's why she can't remember some things,

176
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,440
right?

177
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,120
Will she ever remember?

178
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:24,600
It's hard to say.

179
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,039
Some things she might recall,

180
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,799
but others she might forget completely.

181
00:13:28,679 --> 00:13:30,200
Make sure she takes her medicine on time.

182
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,879
She's in good physical condition,

183
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,480
so she has a chance to recover.

184
00:13:33,799 --> 00:13:34,600
She's not...

185
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:43,279
I'll take care of her.

186
00:13:50,799 --> 00:13:51,399
Kneel down!

187
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,759
This is what you've done in Yunjing.

188
00:13:57,240 --> 00:13:58,639
You've become a scoundrel and a drunkard!

189
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:01,279
Dad, listen to me.

190
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:01,600
I...

191
00:14:01,639 --> 00:14:02,960
I believed your mother's words

192
00:14:03,519 --> 00:14:04,559
and let you study.

193
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,080
But what's the result?

194
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:09,519
Look at you now!

195
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:14,039
You're married, aren't you?

196
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,320
Where's your wife?

197
00:14:17,039 --> 00:14:17,840
She...

198
00:14:18,879 --> 00:14:20,000
She...

199
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,879
You two even dare to trick me together!

200
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,200
What are you looking at?

201
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:28,879
If you dare to do it, you must admit it.

202
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,799
No, dad, it has nothing to do with her.

203
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:32,240
It's all my idea.

204
00:14:33,039 --> 00:14:35,720
It's good that you stand up for your wife.

205
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:37,759
You've made progress.

206
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,200
You did all these

207
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:48,399
just to protect the Sus?

208
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:49,799
Dad,

209
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,759
it's all because of Zhang Xi Yun.

210
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,240
She's targeting me.

211
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,639
I can't drag the Escort Agency into this.

212
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,879
Are you blaming me for not being capable?

213
00:15:01,039 --> 00:15:03,279
In the Yunjing City, everyone can bully you.

214
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:05,200
It's not your fault.

215
00:15:05,919 --> 00:15:07,519
It's my fault that I was too reckless

216
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:08,919
and got you into trouble.

217
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:13,159
I used to discipline you

218
00:15:13,399 --> 00:15:14,840
because I was afraid you would be bullied.

219
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:17,840
Now you know how dangerous the world is.

220
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,759
What are you going to do next?

221
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:21,840
I...

222
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:24,080
Of course, I'm going to eat well,

223
00:15:24,799 --> 00:15:26,120
and take good care of myself.

224
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:43,320
What's that smell on you?

225
00:15:44,759 --> 00:15:47,440
My son is not for you to boss around.

226
00:15:48,799 --> 00:15:50,240
You're really something.

227
00:15:50,279 --> 00:15:51,960
You change your face faster than a book.

228
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,679
Don't forget you owe me three kowtows.

229
00:15:55,639 --> 00:15:56,519
No more waiting.

230
00:15:56,600 --> 00:15:57,480
No more.

231
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,000
Dad.

232
00:15:58,840 --> 00:16:00,639
You... you actually did this for me.

233
00:16:01,879 --> 00:16:02,679
Cheng Qi,

234
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,879
I've never seen

235
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:07,320
I've never seen him give in.

236
00:16:08,039 --> 00:16:10,240
Thanks to you,

237
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:12,279
in my lifetime,

238
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:13,919
I've heard him

239
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,399
say so many soft words.

240
00:16:16,039 --> 00:16:17,200
What are you still talking about?

241
00:16:17,559 --> 00:16:19,120
Go wash yourself clean.

242
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,080
Cheng,

243
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:32,559
you should have a conscience.

244
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:35,480
Without me, could you have saved him?

245
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:39,440
Don't take everything on yourself.

246
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,320
Okay?

247
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,000
It's the emperor

248
00:16:43,399 --> 00:16:45,320
who values Cheng Qi.

249
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:47,039
The emperor is wise.

250
00:16:48,399 --> 00:16:51,879
Cheng Qi has a new task.

251
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:56,919
He'll be under my supervision.

252
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,319
Actually,

253
00:17:12,599 --> 00:17:14,039
I've been looking for a chance

254
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:15,920
to have a drink with you.

255
00:17:18,119 --> 00:17:19,400
In front of the children,

256
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,359
in front of the children.

257
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:23,079
Come on.

258
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,000
Let's drink.

259
00:17:24,039 --> 00:17:24,680
What?

260
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,799
Jiaojiao is missing?

261
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,519
Then go find her.

262
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:28,920
Don't worry, sit down first.

263
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,799
I'll leave early tomorrow morning,

264
00:17:31,039 --> 00:17:32,279
so I come to see you.

265
00:17:33,079 --> 00:17:34,039
It's all Cheng Qi's fault.

266
00:17:34,039 --> 00:17:35,119
He hurt Jiaojiao's heart,

267
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,319
So she took such a risk to go to the border town.

268
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,720
Cheng Qi is now in Huayue Tower.

269
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:42,799
Where is he?

270
00:17:43,799 --> 00:17:45,039
That's more like it.

271
00:17:47,119 --> 00:17:47,920
Cheng Qi.

272
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,160
Who dares to be so rude?

273
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,200
You...

274
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:54,720
Stop it.

275
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:55,400
Dad.

276
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,319
This is Su Yuejiao's brother,

277
00:17:57,319 --> 00:17:58,160
Su Yueqi.

278
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:03,000
So you're the in-law.

279
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:04,839
Who's your in-law?

280
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,200
Cheng Qi doesn't deserve it.

281
00:18:07,279 --> 00:18:08,319
How can you talk like that?

282
00:18:08,839 --> 00:18:10,440
Your sister-in-law is so filial,

283
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,720
but you, as her brother,

284
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:12,839
disrespect the elders.

285
00:18:12,839 --> 00:18:14,599
Aren't you siblings?

286
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:19,000
Jiaojiao's life is uncertain,

287
00:18:19,119 --> 00:18:20,640
he's just worried.

288
00:18:20,799 --> 00:18:21,799
Please forgive him.

289
00:18:21,799 --> 00:18:22,200
Wait.

290
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:23,759
What happened to her?

291
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,720
You care about her?

292
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:27,200
You disappeared.

293
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,000
She searched everywhere for you.

294
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:29,640
But what did you do?

295
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:31,400
You divorced her at this time.

296
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,359
What kind of man are you?

297
00:18:32,440 --> 00:18:33,319
How can you talk like that?

298
00:18:33,319 --> 00:18:33,720
Dad.

299
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,200
Brother.

300
00:18:36,599 --> 00:18:37,720
I know it's my fault.

301
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,039
You can beat me or scold me.

302
00:18:40,079 --> 00:18:40,960
But can you tell me

303
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,000
what happened to her?

304
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,519
She went to Klak City to escort.

305
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:45,200
Her team was robbed by bandits.

306
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,400
She is now in danger.

307
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:46,839
I...

308
00:18:48,799 --> 00:18:50,119
Dad, I'm going to find her.

309
00:18:50,839 --> 00:18:52,000
Go quickly.

310
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:53,000
Yicheng, go with him.

311
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:56,279
Remember, if anything happens to your wife,

312
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,480
I won't forgive you.

313
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:11,839
They've left?

314
00:19:12,799 --> 00:19:15,519
They left early this morning,

315
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,920
heading back to Ning'an with his father.

316
00:19:20,599 --> 00:19:22,440
It doesn't seem like it.

317
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,680
Then what is it? Speak up!

318
00:19:25,279 --> 00:19:25,680
He...

319
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,519
He went to Klak City with the escort agency

320
00:19:27,759 --> 00:19:30,400
to find Su Yuejiao.

321
00:19:48,799 --> 00:19:50,599
♪For a moment of pleasure,♪

322
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:54,039
♪a lifelong obsession.♪

323
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,680
The doctor said you're almost recovered.

324
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:19,680
Just rest a few more days,

325
00:20:19,799 --> 00:20:20,839
and I'll take you back to Langyue.

326
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,240
Langyue?

327
00:20:24,519 --> 00:20:24,880
Yes.

328
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,480
You said you're from Langyue.

329
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,079
You remember now?

330
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:29,240
I...

331
00:20:32,200 --> 00:20:32,680
We're here.

332
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,400
We're the first ones here.

333
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:38,720
Yes, yes.

334
00:20:38,720 --> 00:20:39,640
There's enough for everyone.

335
00:20:40,119 --> 00:20:40,839
I want one too.

336
00:20:40,839 --> 00:20:42,160
And me.

337
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,440
What are they doing?

338
00:20:46,319 --> 00:20:47,680
Maybe they're also brain-damaged.

339
00:20:48,599 --> 00:20:51,200
They're fighting over Cheng Qi's book.

340
00:20:53,839 --> 00:20:54,799
Who's Cheng Qi?

341
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:56,799
Don't you remember?

342
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:00,119
No.

343
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:02,319
It doesn't matter.

344
00:21:02,799 --> 00:21:05,200
Cheng Qi is ungrateful

345
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,400
and shameless.

346
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,200
It's best to forget him.

347
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,039
Who's cursing Cheng Qi?

348
00:21:12,599 --> 00:21:13,680
Do you want to die?

349
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,440
Why can't I curse him?

350
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:20,880
Who are you?

351
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:51,680
You're quite strong,

352
00:21:51,839 --> 00:21:52,720
and have a stubborn streak.

353
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,799
Tie him up and take him back to the mansion.

354
00:21:56,039 --> 00:21:56,599
Yes.

355
00:21:56,839 --> 00:21:57,400
Wait.

356
00:21:59,839 --> 00:22:01,160
You're not from Langyue.

357
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:03,000
Why are you wearing Langyue's clothes?

358
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:04,039
It's none of your business.

359
00:22:04,119 --> 00:22:05,519
He's my escort.

360
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,880
You can't take him away.

361
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,079
This is my turf.

362
00:22:08,079 --> 00:22:09,640
I can do whatever I want.

363
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,640
You're unreasonable.

364
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:13,880
You don't know me?

365
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,240
What's your name?

366
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,559
I'm the head of the Su's Escort Agency,

367
00:22:18,039 --> 00:22:19,359
Su Yuejiao.

368
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,559
Is this your room? Do you like it?

369
00:22:39,640 --> 00:22:41,680
It looks very expensive.

370
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:44,000
I may not be able to afford it.

371
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,240
Xiangyue Tower is mine.

372
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,079
You can live here as long as you want.

373
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:47,319
How can I do that?

374
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:50,119
I'll pay you back after I find the escort.

375
00:22:50,599 --> 00:22:52,400
It's just like the stories.

376
00:22:52,519 --> 00:22:53,440
You know,

377
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,680
your story with Cheng Qi

378
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:56,079
has spread all over Langyue.

379
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,759
After all that,

380
00:22:58,920 --> 00:23:00,680
who exactly is Cheng Qi?

381
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,240
Why do you always bring him up?

382
00:23:02,599 --> 00:23:04,319
How could you not know?

383
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:06,000
Cheng Qi is your husband.

384
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:08,400
Yeah, your husband.

385
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,680
How did you meet?

386
00:23:11,799 --> 00:23:13,039
What do you usually like to do?

387
00:23:13,279 --> 00:23:14,680
What is a matrilocal husband in the Yun State?

388
00:23:14,839 --> 00:23:17,319
Left or right side of the bed?

389
00:23:19,799 --> 00:23:21,240
I really don't know this person.

390
00:23:22,119 --> 00:23:24,759
Why don't you let him go and let him talk?

391
00:23:27,039 --> 00:23:29,200
Cheng Qi is not her husband.

392
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,240
I'd better put it back.

393
00:23:37,319 --> 00:23:38,720
I hit my head.

394
00:23:38,839 --> 00:23:40,200
I can't remember a lot of things.

395
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:42,920
It's hard to ask him clearly if you don't let him talk.

396
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,279
But you know him.

397
00:23:48,440 --> 00:23:49,839
and you know the escort team was robbed.

398
00:23:50,680 --> 00:23:52,279
I just remembered these days.

399
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:55,440
You must be badly hurt

400
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,000
and lost your most beloved memories.

401
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:59,440
You can tell me anything you need.

402
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,359
I'll do my best to help you.

403
00:24:04,279 --> 00:24:05,240
I remember now.

404
00:24:05,799 --> 00:24:07,519
I came to Klak City to deliver goods.

405
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,519
The handover place

406
00:24:09,839 --> 00:24:10,839
is the Xiangyue Tower.

407
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:11,920
What a coincidence.

408
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:12,960
Who are you sending it to?

409
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:13,599
What are you sending?

410
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:17,119
I need to find out who robbed the escort

411
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,799
and who asked me to send a fake one.

412
00:24:20,279 --> 00:24:21,920
Can you help me?

413
00:24:22,039 --> 00:24:23,160
No problem. Leave it to me.

414
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,440
I also need to help you

415
00:24:24,519 --> 00:24:25,720
get back all the memories

416
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:26,640
about Cheng Qi.

417
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:33,119
You're quite tough. I like it.

418
00:24:41,519 --> 00:24:43,880
How could you let that girl get away?

419
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:46,279
What are you doing?

420
00:24:48,599 --> 00:24:50,640
The person you want to kill is too powerful.

421
00:24:52,119 --> 00:24:53,640
I found someone in the army

422
00:24:54,039 --> 00:24:56,480
and told them there were valuables on the escort wagon.

423
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,599
But it was all stones.

424
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,279
And they were also injured.

425
00:25:01,279 --> 00:25:03,160
Now they're asking me for money.

426
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,599
If I don't give them,

427
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:07,799
neither of us will live.

428
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:15,119
You want money before the job is done?

429
00:25:15,319 --> 00:25:16,119
Are you crazy?

430
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,200
No way.

431
00:25:18,279 --> 00:25:19,119
No money.

432
00:25:21,240 --> 00:25:22,519
Fine.

433
00:25:23,759 --> 00:25:25,200
Then give me your life.

434
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:33,559
I know you always carry gold and jewels.

435
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:38,599
You have money.

436
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:40,319
That's not my money.

437
00:25:40,359 --> 00:25:41,880
I can't touch that money.

438
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,720
I'll figure it out.

439
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,519
I don't have any cash on me right now.

440
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:46,440
Next time,

441
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:48,519
I'll bring you money.

442
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:49,279
Fine.

443
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,039
I've prepared it for you.

444
00:25:54,079 --> 00:25:54,880
I.O.U.

445
00:25:56,440 --> 00:25:58,000
Come on, put your fingerprint here.

446
00:26:06,839 --> 00:26:09,759
Remember to bring money with interest next time,

447
00:26:09,799 --> 00:26:11,240
or I'll kill you.

448
00:26:12,440 --> 00:26:13,119
Let's go.

449
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:26,039
Why do the streets of this city

450
00:26:26,039 --> 00:26:27,480
feel like those in Yunjing?

451
00:26:27,799 --> 00:26:28,880
Yeah, they are.

452
00:26:29,079 --> 00:26:31,039
And Klak City is so big.

453
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,200
How can we find her?

454
00:26:37,839 --> 00:26:38,920
You are full of ideas.

455
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:39,880
Why are you so quiet?

456
00:26:40,119 --> 00:26:40,920
Where do we go?

457
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,279
Well,

458
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:45,039
there is a music house called Xiangyue Tower.

459
00:26:45,160 --> 00:26:46,559
I'm going to check it out first.

460
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:49,119
You're a born gambler.

461
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,000
Go by yourself.

462
00:26:55,319 --> 00:26:57,279
Aren't you going to look for your wife?

463
00:26:57,640 --> 00:26:58,359
I am.

464
00:26:58,759 --> 00:27:00,000
The music house is crowded

465
00:27:00,240 --> 00:27:01,720
and full of information.

466
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,160
Jiao is dressed so specially.

467
00:27:03,359 --> 00:27:05,400
I think someone there might have seen her.

468
00:27:06,839 --> 00:27:07,119
Let's go.

469
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:11,799
Bro, where are we going?

470
00:27:20,880 --> 00:27:21,559
Follow him.

471
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:41,880
[It's him.]

472
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:42,759
Let go.

473
00:27:48,920 --> 00:27:50,480
Are you out of your mind?

474
00:27:50,599 --> 00:27:52,279
How can a woman tear a man's clothes?

475
00:27:52,640 --> 00:27:53,720
Shameless.

476
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:55,759
You talk too much.

477
00:27:56,240 --> 00:27:58,000
Don't worry, I'm into you.

478
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,119
I won't hurt you.

479
00:27:59,200 --> 00:28:01,000
I don't even know you.

480
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:02,200
Now you do.

481
00:28:06,359 --> 00:28:07,720
I have someone I like.

482
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:09,400
I know.

483
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:10,920
You like her.

484
00:28:13,799 --> 00:28:14,920
but she doesn't like you.

485
00:28:15,039 --> 00:28:15,920
I like you.

486
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:21,319
Mr. Su

487
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,079
You can live here at ease.

488
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,440
I'll find someone to treat you

489
00:28:24,839 --> 00:28:26,920
and investigate the things you want to know.

490
00:28:29,039 --> 00:28:29,799
Thank you, Miss.

491
00:28:32,119 --> 00:28:34,359
You just come with me.

492
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:35,519
Baby

493
00:28:42,839 --> 00:28:44,200
Be gentle.

494
00:28:44,519 --> 00:28:52,079
Help me! Help me!

495
00:28:55,920 --> 00:28:56,880
Nice body.

496
00:28:58,279 --> 00:28:59,000
Cheers.

497
00:28:59,000 --> 00:28:59,799
Cheers.

498
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:05,240
Cheers.

499
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:12,839
[As the rumors said,]

500
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:16,799
[this is indeed a replica of Huayue Tower.]

501
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:17,680
[Be careful.]

502
00:29:21,839 --> 00:29:22,640
Hello.

503
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:23,319
Sir,

504
00:29:23,319 --> 00:29:24,839
do you want to stay or eat?

505
00:29:25,079 --> 00:29:26,200
I'm here to ask you something.

506
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:28,279
Have you seen a female escort recently?

507
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:31,240
Who are you?

508
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:33,480
I'm her husband.

509
00:29:34,799 --> 00:29:36,000
I have so many customers every day.

510
00:29:36,039 --> 00:29:36,839
I don't remember.

511
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:39,240
Thank you.

512
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:41,880
Then help me get a room.

513
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:42,880
OK.

514
00:29:45,559 --> 00:29:46,160
Thank you.

515
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:53,279
My Lord,

516
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:54,920
don't you want to ask others?

517
00:29:55,079 --> 00:29:56,880
That owner was hesitant,

518
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:57,920
he must have seen her.

519
00:29:58,039 --> 00:29:58,680
Maybe

520
00:29:58,799 --> 00:30:00,039
he knows where she is.

521
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:02,279
This one.

522
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,440
Yicheng, let's stay here first.

523
00:30:03,519 --> 00:30:04,519
Then we can ask him.

524
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:16,240
Jiao?

525
00:30:36,000 --> 00:30:36,480
My Lord

526
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:37,599
My lady, you...

527
00:30:39,839 --> 00:30:40,440
My lady.

528
00:30:44,880 --> 00:30:46,119
In broad daylight,

529
00:30:46,119 --> 00:30:47,920
do you think we don't have anyone here?

530
00:30:51,319 --> 00:30:52,319
I'm talking about you.

531
00:30:52,440 --> 00:30:53,400
Cheng Qi,

532
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,440
do you still have the face to see our boss?

533
00:30:56,559 --> 00:30:57,480
Do you know this person?

534
00:30:58,440 --> 00:30:59,039
Who is he?

535
00:31:18,119 --> 00:31:19,480
I've told you many times.

536
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:20,680
Frisk them.

537
00:31:22,039 --> 00:31:22,440
Yes.

538
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,920
You'll live here from now on.

539
00:31:43,119 --> 00:31:44,400
Tell me if you need anything.

540
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:47,119
I don't live here. Let me go.

541
00:31:47,839 --> 00:31:48,480
No way.

542
00:31:48,799 --> 00:31:50,480
My husband can't live outside.

543
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:54,319
Who's your husband?

544
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:56,200
Am I familiar with you?

545
00:31:56,240 --> 00:31:57,319
My husband?

546
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:02,319
So you want to build a relationship first.

547
00:32:05,839 --> 00:32:07,240
I can let you go out.

548
00:32:11,400 --> 00:32:12,519
But

549
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:14,799
you have to eat with me every day.

550
00:32:14,839 --> 00:32:16,920
You can go out after living here at night.

551
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:18,839
What if I don't agree?

552
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:20,720
This is not bargaining.

553
00:32:20,839 --> 00:32:21,839
This is an order.

554
00:32:31,039 --> 00:32:33,440
It's so cute when you are caught out.

555
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:36,720
You'll fall in love with me soon.
